    },
    {
      "id": "s0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "If both [[p0]][[p1]][[p2]] and [[p3]][[p4]][[p5]] are set, [[p6]][[p7]][[p8]] is evaluated first, then [[p9]][[p10]][[p11]] is looked at. If an AD object matches neither, it is denied.",
      "protected": [
